>Wald</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Quinn</surname><given-names>RR</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Luo</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Scales</surname><given-names>DC</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>Chronic dialysis and death among survivors of acute kidney injury requiring dialysis</article-title>. <source>JAMA</source><volume>302</volume>: <fpage>1179</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>1185</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19755696</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0066776-Goldberg1"><label>10</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Goldberg</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kogan</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hammerman</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Markiewicz</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Aronson</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name> (<year>2009</year>) <article-title>The impact of transient and persistent acute kidney injury on long-term outcomes after acute myocardial infarction</article-title>. <source>Kidney Int</source><volume>76</volume>: <fpage>900</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>910</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19657321</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0066776-Zager1"><label>11</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Zager</surname><given-names>RA</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Johnson</surname><given-names>AC</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Hanson</surname><given-names>SY</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Wasse</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name> (<year>2002</year>) <article-title>Parenteral iron formulations: a comparative toxicologic analysis and mechanisms of cell injury</article-title>. <source>Am J Kidney Dis</source><volume>40</volume>: <fpage>90</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>103</