id-type="pmid">10607912</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0066776-Huang1"><label>25</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Lo</surname><given-names>HC</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Huang</surname><given-names>HH</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Kao</surname><given-names>WF</given-names></name>, <name><surname>Yen</surname><given-names>DH</given-names></name>, <etal>et al</etal> (<year>2007</year>) <article-title>ED presentations of acute renal infarction</article-title>. <source>Am J Emerg Med</source><volume>25</volume>: <fpage>164</fpage>&#x02013;<lpage>169</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17276805</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>